# Marketing site — empty .htaccess on purpose.
# Exists only to overwrite a leftover SPA .htaccess (RewriteRule . /index.html)
# that a misrouted web deploy left in this directory. Apache's defaults are
# sufficient for the Astro static multi-page output: DirectoryIndex resolves
# /pricing → /pricing/index.html on its own. Any caching headers belong in
# server config, not here.
